# NPC/enemy catalogue: identity of every jointed LEVEL class and every SCENE (cutscene) class. Authored 2026-11-17.
# Read by catalogue_full.py, which fails on any class of the source export that is not listed here.
#
# Evidence: native review-renderer front/rear views (npc-catalogue/native, normal decode revision 2), the level each class
# occurs in (story level numbers as in captures/gameplay/all-levels.png), texture-prefix matches to existing reviewed
# assets, exact fingerprints, and exported-mesh signatures (identical positions, UVs and faces) from catalogue_export.
# Confidence: manifest = an existing project manifest or captured asset names the class; visual+level = the render and the
# level settle the role and a named-cast match; visual = descriptive identity from the render only (proper name not
# asserted); signature = identical exported mesh to an identified class; unviewed = no native view (see blocker).
#
# @group | id | section | title | note
@group | nefarious | Story cast | Dr. Nefarious - robot | LEVEL 7662 art pass complete (Codex). Cutscene fingerprint 88217a44 has the identical exported mesh.
@group | lawrence | Story cast | Lawrence - butler | Cutscene-only class 6519 (no LEVEL class): Nefarious's robot butler in every Nefarious cutscene.
@group | lawrence_bassist | Story cast | Lawrence - bassist | Cutscene-only class 7360 (level 20). The earlier candidate 4979 is a museum swordsman.
@group | courtney | Story cast | Courtney Gears | 7109 art pass complete (Codex). 7661 has the same 5,370 triangles but different atlases (00002213 format) and levels 7/21/23.
@group | backup_dancer | Story cast | Courtney Gears backup dancer | Purple female robot dancer on Courtney's level 21.
@group | skrunch | Story cast | Skrunch - standard | 7969 art pass complete (Codex). Class 6816 has the identical fingerprint. Cutscene class 7657 has Skrunch's 3,022 triangles (unviewed).
@group | skrunch_qforce | Story cast | Skrunch - Q-Force outfit | Monkey anatomy, tail and ears of Skrunch in a green hooded Q-Force suit with the Q emblem; four classes share one exported mesh.
@group | helga | Story cast | Helga von Streissenburgen | Class 7014: large figure in a blue suit on Starship Phoenix (levels 3/6); identified by the user.
@group | president | Story cast | President Phyronix | Cutscene-only class 5885 (levels 1/3/4). Class 7014 is Helga.
@group | plumber | Supporting cast | Plumber | Bearded alien in work overalls with tool belt and keys, only on level 28 (the sewers). Replaces the earlier provisional Captain Blackstar match for class 4339.
@group | director | Supporting cast | Holostar Director | Seated in a director's chair with a megaphone, only on level 23 (Holostar Clank level).
@group | slim | Supporting cast | Slim Cognito | Class 6866: his eyes, the only part of him ever shown (Aquatos, level 8).
@group | darla | Supporting cast | Darla Gratch | Cutscene-only class 5859 (level 9), the Channel 64 newsreader.
@group | fred | Supporting cast | Fred | Not found: no short cat-eared alien with round glasses and a lab coat in any of the 1,327 native views (every jointed LEVEL class of the 34 story levels and every cutscene class). Possibly screen-only.
@group | taxi_driver | Supporting cast | Taxi Driver | No driver mesh: the taxi (class 5670) has a closed canopy, and no driver class exists among the 1,327 native views.
@group | maxmillian | Named enemies / bosses | Maxmillian | Not found in any of the 1,327 native views. His film henchmen (robot ninjas 7111/7139) and the Terror of Talos (7129) are on Holostar level 23; no separate villain mesh is among the decoded classes.
@group | gary | Named enemies / bosses | Gary | Class 6684, Annihilation Nation boss.
@group | helen | Named enemies / bosses | Helen | Class 6687, Annihilation Nation boss.
@group | scorpio | Named enemies / bosses | Scorpio | Brain in a glass dome, six wheels, saw-tailed scorpion tail; Annihilation Nation (level 7).
@group | klunk | Named enemies / bosses | Klunk | Not distinguished from the dark-suit Clank art: 6322, 8043 and cutscene class 10's costume 1 share it, and no red-eyed Clank class exists. Cutscene 8069 is standard Clank.
@group | giant_klunk | Named enemies / bosses | Giant Klunk | Class 6666: Giant Clank's mesh with a darker body and orange trim, level 16.
@group | momma_ty | Named enemies / bosses | Momma Tyhrranoid | Class 6623, Tyhrranosis boss.
@group | biobliterator | Named enemies / bosses | Biobliterator (provisional) | Level 20 assembly: giant legs 6554, gun-armed sphere 6556 and crewed pod 6555, viewed from the saved tour8 level 20 frame.
@group | big_al | Existing character variants | Big Al | 6501 art pass complete.
@group | big_al_qforce | Existing character variants | Big Al - Q-Force outfit | Big Al's face, hair and goggles with Q-Force harness, backpack and emblem shirt on Starship Phoenix (levels 3/6). Cutscene class 8049 has the same 4,483 triangles (unviewed).
@group | skidd | Existing character variants | Skidd McMarx - organic | 7012 art pass complete. 6499 and 7209 bind the same two atlases; 7122 binds different atlases. No two share an exported mesh.
@group | skidd_robot | Existing character variants | Skidd McMarx - robot (provisional) | Grey robot with spiked cap and visor on level 3. Cutscene class 7986 (two fingerprints) has the same 3,872 triangles (unviewed).
@group | sasha | Existing character variants | Sasha Phyronix | 7013 has detailed texture layers (no ledger completion). 6642 (levels 21/22) and its cutscene fingerprint share one exported mesh.
@group | qwark_hero | Existing character variants | Captain Qwark - hero uniform | 7000 has detailed texture layers (no ledger completion). 5978 and 6491 share 7000's exported mesh; one of them binds different atlases.
@group | qwark_tribal | Existing character variants | Captain Qwark - jungle/tribal | 6468 (captured as phoenix_crew) art pass complete. 5835 (Florana) and 7063 (museum) have the same 3,684 triangles with their own atlases.
@group | qwark_pajamas | Existing character variants | Captain Qwark - pajamas | Button-up long johns with green gloves, level 19.
@group | rangers | Existing character variants | Galactic Rangers | Captured Veldin pair 5542 (upper) + 6886 (legs) art pass complete. Other upper/leg classes and colourways listed per class.
@group | phoenix_dummies | Generic enemies | Q-Force training dummies | Crash-test-dummy robots on a ball base, Starship Phoenix (level 3); three classes, one atlas.
@group | florana_tribe | Generic enemies | Florana tribal humanoids | Lizard-faced humanoid in a leather vest (2,744 triangles) and a 161-triangle masked figure, level 2 only.
@group | clank_standalone | Player / companion variants | Clank - standalone | Class 87 (L19 slot 60) art pass complete. Cutscene classes 10 and 8069 have Clank's 4,502 triangles (unviewed).
@group | clank_backpack | Player / companion variants | Clank - backpack | Class 601, drawn with Clank's runtime skin; existing refined material-depth edit (blender/edited/clank.*), no ledger completion.
@group | giant_clank | Player / companion variants | Giant Clank | Class 637 now renders with corrected normals (the old preview was empty).
@group | agent_clank | Player / companion variants | Secret Agent Clank | 8043: Clank in black formal wear with bow tie, Holostar Clank level 23. 6322 (level 19) wears the same atlas art.
@group | jeeves | Player / companion variants | Jeeves / chauffeur Ratchet | Cutscene-only class 6320 (Holostar film, level 23): Ratchet in chauffeur costume.
@group | clank_like | Generic enemies | Goggled Clank-level robot | 2404: goggled round robot with a drill tail on the Clank levels 19/23/27; not Clank, Agent Clank or Klunk.
@group | ty_grunts | Generic enemies | Tyhrranoid grunts | Eye-stalked Tyhrranoids. 5821 near mesh art pass complete (fingerprint e9cb753b). 5947 is the atlas of the captured Veldin distant Tyhrranoid and shares its mesh with 6734.
@group | ty_armoured | Generic enemies | Armoured Tyhrranoids | 1,760-triangle armoured three-eyed Tyhrranoids. 7074 fingerprint 076c7522 art pass complete.
@group | ty_mecha | Generic enemies | Mecha-Tyhrranoids | 3,817-triangle walkers. 6306 fingerprint 969e221b art pass complete; 7938 is the larger variant whose atlas the captured distant mesh used.
@group | ty_hoverpod | Generic enemies | Tyhrranoid hover pods | A Tyhrranoid riding an armed hover pod (2,654 triangles).
@group | ty_ships | Generic enemies | Tyhrranoid dropships and fighters | Enemy craft.
@group | reptile_gunners | Generic enemies | Armoured reptilian heavy gunners | Three classes share one exported mesh (green skin, gold armour, dark armour).
@group | robots | Generic enemies | Robot troopers and sentries | Humanoid and walker robots, drones and turrets; descriptive identities.
@group | creatures | Generic enemies | Creatures | Organic enemies outside the Tyhrranoid forces; descriptive identities.
@group | florana_wasp | Generic enemies | Florana wasp | 6619 (captured as florana_creature) art pass complete.
@group | slime | Generic enemies | Sewer/Aquatos slime creatures | Slime monsters and the recurring green blob trio (three outfits per level set).
@group | arena | Annihilation Nation arena | Arena combatants (level 7) | Gladiators, robots, drones and the arena's heavy champions; descriptive identities.
@group | holostar | Holostar film set | Secret Agent Clank film cast (level 23) | Terror of Talos and Maxmillian's robot ninjas.
@group | museum | Insomniac Museum exhibits | Insomniac Museum exhibits (level 24) | Prototype/unused character models on display in the bonus museum level; descriptive identities.
@group | ambient | Ambient creatures | Ambient wildlife | Non-hostile flying creatures (pterosaur-like birds).
@group | vidcomic | Vid-comic (out of scope) | Vid-comic characters and enemies | Levels 30-36. Out of scope: the player dropped the vid-comic levels (PLAN.md 9.2; HANDOVER "Rift Apart remaster of the picture").
@group | weapon_summons | Weapon effects (out of scope) | Weapon-created creatures | Created by the player's weapons (duck/bird transformations, summoned robots); global classes in every story level.
@group | player_gear | Player gear (out of scope) | Ratchet's gear, weapons and armour models | Player equipment, weapon parts and pickups; not NPCs.
@group | vehicles | Vehicles (out of scope) | Vehicles | Driveable or set-dressing vehicles without a character; enemy craft are under ty_ships.
@group | ship_kit | Vehicles (out of scope) | Ratchet's ship kit | Standard ship parts; the three ship art passes are complete and outside this task.
@group | trophies | Props (out of scope) | Trophy room statues and pedestals | Golden trophies on Starship Phoenix (level 3); character-shaped statues are props.
@group | props | Props (out of scope) | Jointed props | Jointed world objects: crates, doors, platforms, machines, signs, vendors.
@group | no_draw | Unresolved identity | Classes the review stage cannot draw | Meshes decode, but their only texture setup is the special -1 register set; the review stage draws them fully transparent (zero pixels in the lit and normals channels), so their shapes are unseen.
