# Named roster entries with no local class (kept so nothing on the cast list is silently dropped).
@group | blackstar | Named enemies / bosses | Captain Blackstar | Class 6694 in the Insomniac Museum (peg leg, cutlass). 4339 is the Plumber. Vid-comic skull heads 5736/6582 are his skull spirit.
@group | screen_cast | Screen / cameo audit | Lance / Janice and other screen-only performers | Screen-only roles; no 3D mesh asserted.
@group | extras | Screen / cameo audit | Cinema audience / background extras | Cutscene class 7529 (blue alien in striped shirt and cap, level 17) is the only unnamed cutscene extra.
